Open Chummer6 and start from the client, not a marketing page.

3
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Build the runner with dense desktop controls and low-noise screens.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Explain values and rule decisions with visible receipts.

5
