10
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Newsreels show campaign movement while the client stays the hero.

11
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:23.000
Desktop and mobile surfaces point at the same release truth.

12
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Chummer6: build the runner, run the table, move the city.
